      "quote": "Clinical Considerations Fetal/Neonatal Adverse Reactions Premature Closure of Fetal Ductus Arteriosus: Avoid use of NSAIDs in women at about 30 weeks gestation and later in pregnancy, because NSAIDs, including ibuprofen oral suspension, can cause premature closure of the fetal ductus arteriosus (see WARNINGS;",
